{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"8b1adca5-f67f-47f9-8e8b-d6650d3dceee","status":"SUCCESS","response":"# Stage 1 \u0026 Stage 2: Upstream Ingestion \u0026 Functionality Understanding Check\n\n### 1. Upstream Specification Ingestion\n- **Governing Specification:** [`functional_specification_001.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/functional_specification_001.md)\n- **Governing Taxonomy:** [`LANGUAGE.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/LANGUAGE.md)\n- **Run Identifier:** `20261008T232953-546-t6ji`\n\n### 2. Functionality Understanding Check (`/functionality-understanding-check`)\n\n#### Operational Objective \u0026 Business Context\nThe ChoppedPoker repository currently houses six disjoint static HTML documents:\n1. `index.html`: Central portal with animated suit particles, marquee ticker, and 3D glassmorphism navigation cards.\n2. `CHECK_BET_EVs.html`: Brutalist Check vs. Bet EV decision engine with indifference MDF calculation and parallax background.\n3. `TURNRANGECOMPOSITION.html`: Technical blueprint range composition visualizer filtering value vs. air combos from flop to turn.\n4. `betMap.html`: Swiss International Typographic Style 2D strategy heatmap calculating optimal big-blind defense (Fold, Call-Fold, Call-Call) across turn/river c-bet frequencies with live canvas pixel shading and crosshair telemetry.\n5. `math.html`: Editorial print style Equilibrium Constructor computing multi-street Geometric Growth of Pot (GGOP), recursive bluff allocation, and anchored 3D flip-card popovers with KaTeX formulas.\n6. `BluffingMath.html`: Liquid glassmorphism math breakdown decomposing Equation 11.7 (Cost vs. Bluff Efficiency) with interactive hover zones and dynamic explanations.\n\nWhile each tool implements sound Game Theory Optimal (GTO) poker mathematics, separating them across distinct HTML documents fragments the pedagogical flow, introduces disruptive browser navigations, and prevents users from experiencing poker theory as a continuous progression from street-by-street range filtering to multi-street geometric equilibrium.\n\nThe objective is to consolidate all six distinct tools into a **single, unified, standalone static HTML application** (`index.html`) that satisfies three foundational pillars:\n1. **Strict Content Identity:** Preserve 100% of mathematical formulas, UI inputs/sliders, calculation parameters, updated baseline defaults, visual themes, popover mechanics, and interactive telemetry from the source tools.\n2. **Seamless Scrolly-Telling Progression:** Orchestrate a continuous narrative flow with a persistent global chapter progress navigation rail, synchronized scroll intersection tracking, and harmonious aesthetic transitions between chapters.\n3. **Flawless Interaction \u0026 Scroll Hygiene:** Completely eliminate scroll-trapping over range sliders, isolate canvas drag events from page scroll gestures, and gracefully release sticky control panels at section boundaries.\n\n#### Alignment Evaluation\n- **Specification Alignment:** Evaluated against [`LANGUAGE.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/LANGUAGE.md). The requirements in `functional_specification_001.md` are unambiguous, complete, and mathematically rigorous.\n- **Alignment Gate:** **ALIGNED**. No ambiguities, contradictions, or missing telemetry exist. The specification is ready for architectural decomposition.\n\n---\n\nProceeding to **Stage 3: Wayfinder Map \u0026 Destination Initialization**.\n# Wayfinder Feature Planning \u0026 Architectural Decision Report\n\n## 1. Governing Specification Context\n- **Specification Title:** [Functional Specification 001: Unified ChoppedPoker Static Engine — Full Content Consolidation, Seamless Scrolly-Telling Transitions, and High-Fidelity Interactive Simulation](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/functional_specification_001.md)\n- **Governing Taxonomy:** [`LANGUAGE.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/LANGUAGE.md)\n- **Run Identifier:** `20261008T232953-546-t6ji`\n\n---\n\n## 2. Functionality Understanding Check Report (`/functionality-understanding-check`)\n- **Operational Objective:** Consolidate six standalone poker simulation tools ([`index.html`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/index.html), [`CHECK_BET_EVs.html`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/CHECK_BET_EVs.html), [`TURNRANGECOMPOSITION.html`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/TURNRANGECOMPOSITION.html), [`betMap.html`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/betMap.html), [`math.html`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/math.html), and [`BluffingMath.html`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/BluffingMath.html)) into a single, unified, standalone static HTML application ([`index.html`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/index.html)) with zero loss of interactive capabilities or visual polish.\n- **Core Pillars:**\n  1. *Strict Content Identity:* Preserve 100% of mathematical equations, input sliders, calculation parameters, default baselines, visual representations, popover explanations, and live readouts across all six source files.\n  2. *Seamless Scrolly-Telling Progression:* Present a continuous narrative flow via a persistent global chapter progress rail, synchronized scroll intersection tracking, and aesthetic transitions.\n  3. *Flawless Interaction \u0026 Scroll Hygiene:* Eliminate wheel event hijacking on range sliders, isolate 2D heatmap canvas drags with pointer capture, and gracefully release sticky control panels at section boundaries.\n- **Alignment Gate:** **ALIGNED**. The requirements in `functional_specification_001.md` are comprehensive, mathematically sound, and fully aligned with system invariants.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Wayfinder Orchestration Summary\n- **Canonical Roadmap Map:** [`wayfinder/20261008T232953-546-t6ji/map.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/wayfinder/20261008T232953-546-t6ji/map.md)\n- **Monotonic Decision Tickets Charted \u0026 Resolved:**\n  1. [Ticket 001: Global Document Shell, Semantic Layout, and Namespace Isolation Architecture](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/wayfinder/20261008T232953-546-t6ji/tickets/ticket-001.md) — Locked unified DOM structure under `#portal-nexus`, `#ev-engine`, `#range-filter`, `#strategy-heatmap`, `#equilibrium-constructor`, and `#bluff-efficiency`. Enforced scoped CSS classes (`.section-ev`, `.section-turn`, etc.) and modular JavaScript namespaces (`window.ChoppedPoker.*`) to prevent symbol and property clashes.\n  2. [Ticket 002: Scrolly-Telling Orchestration, Global Chapter Rail, and Backdrop Transitions](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/wayfinder/20261008T232953-546-t6ji/tickets/ticket-002.md) — Implemented persistent right-side fixed chapter navigation rail with bi-directional `IntersectionObserver` synchronization, smooth-scroll anchor jumps, gradient blend transitions, and lifecycle opacity fade-out / animation pausing for the Section 0 particle canvas.\n  3. [Ticket 003: Scroll \u0026 Gesture Hygiene: Isolation of Sliders, Canvas Drag, and Sticky Sidebars](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/wayfinder/20261008T232953-546-t6ji/tickets/ticket-003.md) — Suppressed wheel event scrubbing on range sliders with `touch-action: pan-y`, configured explicit pointer capture (`setPointerCapture`) on `#hm-canvas` allowing unimpeded vertical window scrolling, and bounded sticky sidebar containment within section heights.\n  4. [Ticket 004: Mathematical Models, Baseline Values, and Precision Calibration](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/wayfinder/20261008T232953-546-t6ji/tickets/ticket-004.md) — Calibrated updated default baseline parameters across all sections, locked exact mathematical computation logic (MDF $\\alpha = 57.1\\%$, $\\Delta EV = +7.50$, Value Comp $= 53.8\\%$, GGOP $R=16.0$, $r=300\\%$), established zero-combo edge case handling ($0\\%/0\\% \\to 50\\%/50\\%$ bar and `\"-\"` text), and enforced pure white pixel coloring for the impossible strategy region ($c_T \u003c N$).\n  5. [Ticket 005: Interactive Modals, Canvas High-DPI Scaling, and Boundary Collision Safeguards](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/wayfinder/20261008T232953-546-t6ji/tickets/ticket-005.md) — Defined anchored 3D flip-card popover algorithms with horizontal viewport collision detection, dynamic KaTeX re-rendering inside popovers, Section 0 card tilt perspective, and Retina HiDPI canvas backing store scaling.\n  6. [Ticket 006: Error Governance, CDN Resilience, and Acceptance Criteria Verification Framework](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/ChoppedPoker/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261008T232953-546-t6ji/wayfinder/20261008T232953-546-t6ji/tickets/ticket-006.md) — Pinned CDN references to KaTeX 0.16.9 and Google Fonts, established fail-fast DOM element verification, and codified an objective verification protocol mapped to AC-01 through AC-10.\n- **Frontier \u0026 Blocking Status:** All 6 decision tickets are fully